# Store listing copy. These files no longer live here — the canonical home is the
# FillDuck project directory (013-fillduck/projects/form-pilot/, itself git-ignored
# there), because FillDuck is what reads them and fills the Chrome / Edge / AMO
# back offices. Nothing in this repo reads them.
